                  "Value": "'The Top 10 stations are selected by full-period activity (rentals + returns), not by imbalance. Morning = 07:00–09:59; Evening = 17:00–19:59. Net flow = returns − rentals. Because redistribution is not observed, net flow should not be interpreted as inventory change or evidence of bike shortages or full stations. Peak timing alone does not establish trip purpose.'"
